Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.29,0:02:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fs66\c&H874B45&\3c&HF5F5F5&\bord9\pos(585,954)\frz18.77}收件日期
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.61,0:02:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,這個污漬大概一個星期了 我怎麼搓都搓不掉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.08,0:02:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,放了一個星期嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.97,0:02:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,可以請問這是什麼污漬嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.41,0:02:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是義大利麵的番茄醬汁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.47,0:02:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你覺得洗得掉嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.83,0:02:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,交給金目就對了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.95,0:03:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那再麻煩你了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.89,0:03:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.95,0:03:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\b1\shad0\c&H8FC3C9&\3c&H8D7A57&\fad(1,441)}金目洗衣店
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.55,0:04:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(481,276)\an9\fs54\shad6\c&H222C04&\3c&HC7CBB5&\blur3\bord6\4c&HC7CD96&\t(2983,1984,1 \blur0\bord0\shad0)\pos(1814.4,159.999)}第{\c&H8065C7&}1{\c&H222C04&}話\h\h\h\h{\fs60}交給{\c&H8F8B3E&\3c&HEDD7D3&}金目{\c&H222C04&}就對了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.51,0:04:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\frz335.6\bord0\shad0\c&H46464C&\fs54\move(909,549,933,540,0,2485)}交件日期為{\c&H3030A0&\b1\fs78}16{\c&H46464C&\b0\fs54}天
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.83,0:04:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿咻
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.41,0:05:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\pos(156,363)\b1\c&H4C4A46&\3c&HE3DBD5&\fad(1,1150)}定時
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.41,0:05:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\b1\c&H555152&\3c&HE7E8E9&\pos(963,384)\fs90}開始
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.41,0:05:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\b1\c&H555152&\3c&HE7E8E9&\fs90\pos(969,789)}暫停
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.12,0:05:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.71,0:05:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜猜看喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.40,0:05:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.56,0:05:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你現在是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.58,0:05:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,很想吃點甜的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.05,0:05:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.90,0:06:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝你 矢柄小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.78,0:06:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我正好想吃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.17,0:06:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,這是我先生出差帶回來的伴手禮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.29,0:06:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我來泡茶 你要一起嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.66,0:06:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不用了 我等一下就要回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.04,0:06:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 那我先把你的衣服拿出來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.47,0:06:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你今天也是騎腳踏車來的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.69,0:06:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.57,0:06:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡坡道這麼多 你好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.07,0:06:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H323839&\3c&H77AD8F&\shad0}感謝您的惠顧\N{\b1}金目洗衣店
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.82,0:06:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝 在熱海騎腳踏車可以練肌肉喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.58,0:06:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,一套西裝的上下身跟五件襯衫 這樣對嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.47,0:06:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.21,0:06:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,啊對了 我先生說
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.16,0:06:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,自從開始把衣服拿來這裡洗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.58,0:06:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他的西裝就變得非常好穿
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.97,0:06:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,咦 真的嗎 太好了 我店裡的襯衫跟西裝都是水洗的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.58,0:06:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,咦 西裝不是都乾洗嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.72,0:06:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,乾洗確實是比較普遍的做法
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.71,0:07:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,這是我們店裡的小祕訣…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.67,0:07:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.42,0:07:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我會把衣服一件一件放進雙層洗衣網 然後用清水仔細清洗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.32,0:07:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,然後晾一整晚讓它自然風乾
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.75,0:07:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,隔天早上 再用烘衣機稍微烘一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.18,0:07:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,讓布料恢復蓬鬆感
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.88,0:07:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,接著再花比平常更長的時間仔細熨燙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.08,0:07:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,正面反面都要燙過 把縫線也仔細拉平
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.75,0:07:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣穿起來應該會很舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.13,0:07:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.82,0:07:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的很喜歡洗衣服耶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.27,0:07:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.58,0:07:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟這是我唯一沒有忘記的事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.96,0:07:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,小金目 那我先走囉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.42,0:07:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝您
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.49,0:08:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 已經這麼晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.55,0:08:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\frz248.1\shad0\c&H5A6D8D&\3c&HB0C4DA&\fs81\pos(672,546)\frx10\fry334}本日營業結束
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.67,0:08:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\c&H5A6D8D&\3c&HB0C4DA&\fs81\frx10\fry334\frz272\pos(819,474)}本日營業結束
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.80,0:08:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\c&H5A6D8D&\3c&HB0C4DA&\fs81\frz297.4\pos(915,378)}本日營業結束
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.92,0:08:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\c&H5A6D8D&\3c&HB0C4DA&\fs81\frz323.5\pos(939,339)}本日營業結束
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.05,0:08:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\c&H5A6D8D&\3c&HB0C4DA&\fs81\pos(912,249)\frz351.7}本日營業結束
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.21,0:08:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\c&H5A6D8D&\3c&HB0C4DA&\fs81\frz356.6\pos(921,303)}本日營業結束
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.30,0:08:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\c&H5A6D8D&\3c&HB0C4DA&\fs81\frz0.2495\pos(957,363)}本日營業結束
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.42,0:08:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\c&H5A6D8D&\3c&HB0C4DA&\fs81\frz0.2495\pos(948,537)}本日營業結束
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.55,0:08:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\c&H5A6D8D&\3c&HB0C4DA&\fs81\frz0.2495\pos(972,543)}本日營業結束
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.63,0:08:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\c&H5A6D8D&\3c&HB0C4DA&\fs81\frz0.2495\pos(978,567)}本日營業結束
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.71,0:08:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\c&H5A6D8D&\3c&HB0C4DA&\fs81\pos(963,564)\frz358.7}本日營業結束
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.80,0:08:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs81\frz0.2495\c&H5A6D8D&\3c&HB0C4DA&\pos(987,564)\t(2274,2275,1 \c&H0E2D65&\3c&H406794&)}本日營業結束
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.03,0:08:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.16,0:08:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.58,0:08:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,今天謝謝你了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.45,0:08:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,您襯衫上的污漬已經清掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.10,0:08:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,真的嗎 那件我還滿喜歡的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.21,0:08:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.99,0:08:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不會
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.59,0:08:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs51\shad0\c&H778A95&\3c&HF5F2F1&\pos(957.999,18)}請\N確\N實\N關\N閉\N熱\N水
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.59,0:08:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那我先走了 晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.55,0:08:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.05,0:09:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,今天的工作也順利完成了
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.30,0:09:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,老闆娘 晚安
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.59,0:09:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安 歡迎再來喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.72,0:09:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,啊對喔 今天有煙火大會
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.31,0:09:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,難怪外面這麼熱鬧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.72,0:09:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,既然這樣 不如把煙火聲當成背景音樂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.34,0:09:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,再多工作一下好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.12,0:10:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1344,147)\b1\c&HCEC0B7&\3c&H9A501C&\shad0}伴手禮店
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.12,0:10:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1\c&HDCCCC2&\3c&H9A501C&\pos(609,282)\shad0}熱海魚乾店
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.31,0:11:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 是小金目
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.11,0:11:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,早啊 你真早起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.37,0:11:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,今天店休嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.98,0:11:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 不是的 我開店前會運動一下 讓自己清醒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.31,0:11:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是喔 這樣就完全清醒了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.30,0:11:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…其實我不太習慣早起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.58,0:11:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,看不出來耶 你看起來很可靠
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.14,0:11:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,對啊 對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.59,0:11:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.20,0:11:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀 好乖好乖
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.23,0:11:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那我先走了 再見
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.15,0:11:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.65,0:12:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs52\an8\c&H6E675B&\3c&HF7EEDF&\pos(762,230.001)}民宿 石持
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.02,0:12:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他應該是那間民宿的兒子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.28,0:12:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,記得他好像是高中生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.91,0:12:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,一大早就幫忙做事 真了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.75,0:12:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 我得趕快回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.21,0:12:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.81,0:12:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,小波利 早安
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.58,0:12:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\frx8\fry350\c&H70625B&\3c&HAEBCC2&\fs90\frz3.405\pos(846,336)}歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.58,0:12:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,今天也要加油
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.39,0:13:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.60,0:13:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,小金目 今天也要麻煩你了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.31,0:13:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 我看一下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.11,0:13:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,咦 這件衣服您之前是不是也拿來過
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.94,0:13:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,對 拿來過一次
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.07,0:13:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我好像記得這個布料
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.97,0:13:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(793,1)\bord0\shad0\c&H46464C&\fs54\frz359.4\pos(1017,51)}交件日期為{\c&H3030A0&\b1\fs78}16{\c&H46464C&\b0\fs54}天
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.82,0:13:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,小金目 我要來拿上次送洗的衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.28,0:13:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨 可以讓我看一下收據嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.50,0:13:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.23,0:13:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是這件沒錯嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.15,0:13:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.71,0:13:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,這是您的衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.45,0:13:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.28,0:14:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝您
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.03,0:14:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,您好 這裡是金目洗衣店
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,明天16點要收件嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.42,0:14:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.50,0:14:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,249)}請問您的地址是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.69,0:14:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\c&H70625B&\3c&HAEBCC2&\fs81\an9\frz6.011\pos(1095.999,105.999)}暫時外出 馬上回來\N{\shad0\c&H70625B&\3c&HAEBCC2&}店主
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.94,0:14:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\frz6.687\shad0\b1\fs48\c&H606B76&\3c&HCDD3D4&\move(1569,621,1569,489,0,2982)}所有披薩85折!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.45,0:14:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\frx8\fry350\c&H70625B&\3c&HAEBCC2&\fs90\pos(822,417)\frz3.142}歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.47,0:14:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.22,0:14:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,安治小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.18,0:15:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我正打算過去你那裡一趟
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.89,0:15:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,想拿這個月的房租給你 順便收衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.48,0:15:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不用這樣啦 你太寵我了 我會不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.30,0:15:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,可是這裡坡道這麼多 你要特地過來很辛苦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.11,0:15:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你也一樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.38,0:15:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,這麼說也是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.07,0:15:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 我差點忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.24,0:15:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(770,276)\an8\shad0\pos(993,414)\c&H575F65&\3c&H93B3C9&}五月份房租
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.11,0:15:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(770,1144)\an8\shad0\c&H575F65&\3c&H93B3C9&\pos(486,333)\frz358.8}金目綿花奈
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.11,0:15:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(770,268)\an8\shad0\c&H575F65&\3c&H93B3C9&\frz358.8\fs48\pos(495,480)}金目洗衣店
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.67,0:15:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,這是房租 謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.53,0:15:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好 謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.26,0:15:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,時間過得真快 你已經來這裡兩年了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.31,0:15:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 謝謝你一直以來的照顧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.69,0:15:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我什麼也沒做啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.62,0:15:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 客人送了我一些點心 你要留下來喝杯茶嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.87,0:15:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,真的嗎 那我就不客氣了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.45,0:15:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.28,0:16:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,下雨了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.29,0:16:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,明明天氣還這麼好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.68,0:16:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.80,0:16:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,啊… 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.75,0:16:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,這個
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.88,0:16:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,請問是要送洗的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.56,0:16:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.89,0:16:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 對了 我先幫您檢查一下衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.45,0:16:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,請問您有會員卡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.69,0:16:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.63,0:16:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是我媽媽的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.28,0:16:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 原來是石持家的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.59,0:16:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你今天來幫媽媽跑腿嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.50,0:17:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 她好像很忙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.79,0:17:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是喔 這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.47,0:17:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 這裡好像有點脫線
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.07,0:17:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,可以請你確認一下嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.25,0:17:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.73,0:17:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,呃…怎麼了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.35,0:17:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,沒 沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.49,0:17:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…有什麼問…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.75,0:17:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.59,0:17:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.25,0:17:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那 那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.36,0:17:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,砂紙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.13,0:17:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,請問這個刮痕是怎麼造成的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.17,0:17:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,咦 喔 大概是磨到水泥牆吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.04,0:17:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是摩擦造成的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.16,0:17:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.29,0:17:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我馬上處理好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.61,0:18:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.27,0:18:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\b1\pos(957,1050)\c&H424248&\3c&HCEE1E2&}洗衣師證照
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.40,0:18:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,這只是應急處理 不過刮痕應該有變淡一點了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.81,0:18:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害 這裡不是洗衣店嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.05,0:18:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 是啊 但這也是一種 自古流傳下來的洗衣技術
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.61,0:18:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,先用砂紙磨平刮痕
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.04,0:18:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,再用補色膏補上顏色 就完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.54,0:18:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,補色膏…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.93,0:18:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我們店裡除了衣服之外 當然也能清洗鞋子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.58,0:18:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,布包或皮包之類的小東西也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.58,0:18:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,只要客人有需要 我都會盡心盡力地處理
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.82,0:19:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 真對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.66,0:19:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,只是… 是我看到鞋子上的刮痕就忍不住…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.03,0:19:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,明明你根本沒拜託我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.12,0:19:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我又多管閒事了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.59,0:19:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,這個當然不用收錢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.98,0:19:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你不滿意 我也可以賠償
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.36,0:19:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不用 沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.98,0:19:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,這是您的收據
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.98,0:19:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\shad0\c&H612E2A&\3c&HAAAFAD&\b1\fs48}明明洗過了卻不乾淨\N\N{\3c&H48407D&\c&HAFAEBB&}那是…\N  {\c&H000000&\3c&HBDBFBD&}因為您用的洗法\N和 {\c&HB2B9B5&\3c&H34267B&}髒污的種類 {\c&H872423&\3c&HBDBFBD&}不合\N\N{\c&H696566&\3c&HD4D4D4&}金目洗衣店會根據\N髒污種類\N提供最適合的洗滌方式
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.23,0:19:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝您的惠顧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.08,0:19:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,雨好像變大了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.99,0:19:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…如果不介意的話 這把傘可以借你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.87,0:19:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不然鞋子會淋濕的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.72,0:19:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,非常謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.36,0:19:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎您再度光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.04,0:19:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.91,0:20:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,下次可以拿我的書包來洗嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.70,0:20:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 交給金目就對了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.65,0:20:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我本來以為洗衣店都差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.53,0:20:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H568135&\3c&H81B554&\shad0}提供到府收送\N{\c&H000000&\3c&HBDBFBD&}金目洗衣店\N{\c&H568135&\3c&H81B554&}歡迎隨時來電
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.91,0:20:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,現在我好像有點懂了 為什麼媽媽最近都把衣服送到這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.01,0:22:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\b1\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(315,276)\fs90}金目的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.01,0:22:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\b1\c&H000000&\fs90\bord0\pos(870,447)}速記小教室
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.61,0:22:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,金目速記小教室
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.01,0:22:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,大家好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.69,0:22:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,初次見面 我是金目綿花奈
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.02,0:22:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,接下來要為大家介紹我的日常生活 以及店裡的配置
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.36,0:22:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}金目小姐的一天(平日篇)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.59,0:22:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(45,39)\3c&HEEF59A&\c&H000000&}起床\N晨跑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.38,0:22:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(45,39)\3c&H95D976&\c&H000000&}淋浴、早餐
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.36,0:22:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我的一天是從晨跑開始的
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.44,0:22:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然我不太習慣早起
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.39,0:22:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不過沿著海岸線跑步 看著漂亮的風景就能讓我清醒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.47,0:22:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(45,39)\3c&H98FABD&\c&H000000&}開店準備
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.39,0:22:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(45,39)\3c&H83EDF7&\c&H000000&}開店\N\N熨燙前一天\N晾乾的衣物\N\N接待客人\N(早上客人很多\N有時會很忙)
Dialogue: 1,0:22:25.72,0:22:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,回家之後就開始準備開店
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.28,0:22:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,早上主要是熨燙衣物和接待客人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.61,0:22:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\3c&H8CB7F3&\c&H000000&}休息時間\N\N 去超市買東西\N\N常常在麵包店\N解決午餐
Dialogue: 1,0:22:32.51,0:22:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,午休過後 除了接待客人 還要處理污漬 洗衣服
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.90,0:22:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,洗完的衣服還要烘乾或晾乾
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.56,0:22:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,在空檔時間還要出去收送件
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.27,0:22:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\3c&HA189F1&\c&H000000&}整理收來的衣物\N\N處理污漬\N洗好幾批衣服\N\N 將洗好的衣服陰乾\N(一晚到兩天)\N\N接待客人\N(傍晚時段\N會比較悠閒)\N\N 利用空檔收送件
Dialogue: 1,0:22:42.85,0:22:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,有些店家早上跟下午的工作內容 可能會跟我相反
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.96,0:22:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,工作結束之後 我會去泡溫泉放鬆身心
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.16,0:22:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不過在忙碌的時期就沒辦法去了
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.62,0:23:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,然後大概晚上十點上床睡覺 我的一天就是這樣度過的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.79,0:22:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\3c&HF0B5D3&\c&H000000&}關店\N\N 在附近的澡堂或\N溫泉放鬆\N\N晚餐\N\N 結帳
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.88,0:23:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\3c&HEE979A&\c&H000000&}睡覺
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.73,0:23:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,接著是店裡的配置介紹
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.37,0:23:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,一進門就會看到我的金魚 小波利迎接大家
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.30,0:23:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,櫃檯周圍放的是客人送洗的衣物
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.94,0:23:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,窗邊是熨燙區 裡面有去漬台
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.72,0:23:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,以及洗衣機和烘衣機
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.13,0:23:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,再往裡面走 有通往後院的門
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.41,0:23:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,還有通往二樓的樓梯 以及一個休息室
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.26,0:23:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,以上就是我的日常生活 以及金目洗衣店的配置介紹
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.90,0:23:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,今後也請大家多多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.02,0:23:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\c&H020201&\bord0\pos(990,465)}第{\c&H8A80CC&}2{\c&H020201}話 {\c&HA49F43&}源泉{\c&H020201&}直流是我們的驕傲
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.92,0:23:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,下回預告 「因為源泉直流是我們的驕傲」
